{"id":"en_trapped-between-two-monsters","title":"Trapped Between Two Monsters","titleEn":"Trapped Between Two Monsters","description":"Ketki is stuck in a marriage that has long since lost any affection, and her life takes a turn when she reconnects with Vedika, a friend from her childhood. What begins as a reunion gradually becomes something far more intense, as Vedika's feelings for Ketki deepen into an obsessive love. The story follows the tension between Ketki's unhappy married life and the increasingly possessive pull of her old friend, leaving her caught between two difficult situations.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_trapped-between-two-monsters/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_trapped-between-two-monsters/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Serendipity","Enemies to Lovers","دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehu/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_trapped-between-two-monsters_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehu/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trapped-between-two-monsters_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehu/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trapped-between-two-monsters_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5ehu/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trapped-between-two-monsters_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.